{{Term/Store|Warm Safflina|Warm Safflinas|Series, BotW, TotK, AoC, AoI|plural}} are recurring [[Item]]s in {{TLoZ Series}}.<ref name="BotW Inventory"/><ref name="TotK Inventory"/><ref name="AoC Material"/><ref name="AoI Materials"/>

==Location and Uses==
==={{BotW|-}}===
{{Compendium/Extract|Warm Safflina}}
Warm Safflinas are found in [[Hyrule Ridge]] and the [[Gerudo Desert]]. Many Warm Safflinas can be found near [[Tera's Great Fairy Fountain]] under the [[Gerudo Great Skeleton]]. [[Meal]]s made in a [[Cooking Pot]] using a Warm Safflina will give [[Link]] [[Cold Resistance]] when eaten.<ref name="BotW Inventory"/> They can also be used at the [[Kochi Dye Shop]] to make Orange [[Dye]].

Like other [[Flower]]s, Warm Safflinas can be used in a Cooking Pot to make the following Meals: 
